==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|fiu-fin-pro|*hirvi}}, borrowed from {{der|fi|bat-pro|<!-- *širw- -->}}. Related to {{cog|et|hirv}}, {{cog|vep|hirb'}}. {{doublet|fi|sarvi}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-pronunciation}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# [[elk]], [[moose]] (''[[Alces alces]]'')
# any large deer, such as an elk, moose or [[wapiti]]
# [[meat]] of these animals
# short for {{m|fi|hirvieläin}}

